      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yea, definitely not gonna use this service, especially the fact that \"posting a selfie + gov ID UNEDITED\" is ringing my alarm bells, hell, I don't want to display my name and other sensitive information, while it's all about the age exclusively, on top of that to a company located in the US, which has already class action lawsuits (data abuse) against it, being in charge of this service.\n\nCouldn't VRC find any better company, which is ONLY in the business for verifications without the cluster duck of storing and selling (/ abusing) data for their own profit? Like wth?",
